# Supabase Function Secrets Configuration
# Add these to: Supabase Dashboard → Project Settings → Secrets

# Option 1: Using OpenAI (Recommended for better quality)
# Get your API key from: https://platform.openai.com/api/keys
OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-... (your OpenAI API key here)
OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini

# Option 2: Using Lovable Gateway (Free alternative)
# Get your API key from: https://lovable.dev
LOVABLE_API_KEY=... (your Lovable API key here)

# Note: If both are provided, OpenAI will be used first
# If you only have one, that one will be used
